\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl202\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 . Good shepherd you came from heaven
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj into this sinful world;
\par You are my only King, my Priest
\par and my only Prophet.
\par Your word is good, suitable food for my soul
\par If I possess you it's enough.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Good shepherd you gave up your whole
\par      life for all the lost sheep
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Deep, deep love you sacrificed to save
\par them all from their sins
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj You shed your blood, bought  them for
\par yourself so that
\par they could receive your heav'nly peace.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Good shepherd you know your own
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and your own also knows you
\par  just as the Father knows you and you
\par also know him well
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This love made you laid down your
\par life for the sheep
\par that you also loved so dearly.       \tab 
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Good shepherded all people on this
\par      earth are all your good flock
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj All the heathen you with your own
\par voice called all to yourself,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj you shall heed to all who do
\par mention your name
\par and be among your loving  sheep.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Good  shepherded, let me hear your    \tab 
\par      own voice which calleth me now,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Let me come follow you in
\par joy or in time of distress
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let your words give me
\par comfort where-'er I go.
\par Jesus my Master dwell in me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. I am a poor man, without much    \tab 
\par      strength who's being sought after,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 by satan who's determined to
\par destroy me by all means,
\par Lord protect me I take my refuge in you
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Don't let him take me from your hands.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

